    "description": {
      "type": "String",
      "label": "Description",
      "value": "<p>Illuminated by the holy light of the Lady, you empower everyone around you with the will to ride forth in the name of quest and glory. Gain +Fellowship Bonus Armour Points on all locations, and +1 War Leader Talent while the spell is active. For every +2 SL, you may increase your Armour Points by +1, or take the War Leader Talent again.</p><p><strong>Lore:</strong> Grail magics use the lore effects and ingredients of your Troth Wind (Azyr, Ghur, or Ghyran). See @UUID[Compendium.wfrp4e-nom.nom-journals.JournalEntry.szhETavVooj84NXa.JournalEntryPage.n0mJrnlLoreGrail]{Lore of the Grail}.</p>"
